What is proved below (all unconditional, fully closed, `zetaCellS0 = ⟨0.395,-8.75⟩`):
* (a) `zetaFE_cpow_lower_S0` (`1/7 ≤ ‖(2π)^(-s0)‖`).
* (b) `zetaFE_cos_lower_S0` (`1 ≤ ‖cos(π*s0/2)‖`).
