/-- (C) Amplitude upper `D3_amp 13 ≤ 1/4` (via `14^{3/5} ≥ 4`,
    cleared: `4^5 = 1024 ≤ 2744 = 14^3`, since `3/5 ≤ 0.605`; mirrors
